if amicable good faith efforts fail after 90 days.\n\n---\n\n#### **3. Key Financial & Technical Terms**\n*   **Nameplate Capacity:** Limited to a maximum of **10 kW**; modification to increase this is prohibited (Clause 5.1.3).\n*   **Inverter Rating / Solar Array Rating:** Technical specifications from Part 1 that the Supplier is barred from modifying (Clause 5.1.4).\n*   **LDC (Local Distribution Company):** The entity that must own and operate the Facility’s meter.\n*   **Minimum Required Domestic Content Level:** Data required to ensure the facility meets Ontario-sourced equipment requirements.\n*   **Reference Number:** The unique identifier required for all formal e-mail communications with the OPA.\n*   **Generation Payment:** Financial payments for electricity; OPA has the right to audit settlement statements and invoices to verify accuracy."}, :duration-ms 5177, :event/tags #{[:node #uuid "d05aaf33-194e-4eb5-a76f-5b9a0d02d9bf"] [:sheet #uuid "b5bd8208-dee2-409f-b862-7761ff30e225"] [:tick #uuid "219b2581-94f2-4a59-a930-d4b10b8a2717"]}, :event/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T21:11:13.023951-05:00", :usage {:prompt-tokens 2931, :completion-tokens 799, :total-tokens 3730}, :inputs {:ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-index 1, :ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-parent #uuid "686d8b87-d077-4284-940d-9e0382fc6c0f"}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "d05aaf33-194e-4eb5-a76f-5b9a0d02d9bf", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-completed, :sheet-id #uuid "b5bd8208-dee2-409f-b862-7761ff30e225", :event/id #uuid "019e4326-bdff-7023-8624-cf7e8a116718"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3Z8TXwAAXxUttvIUwSkGAE0Dv54z3g", :mulog/timestamp 1779243073025, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3Z8TXwAAXxUttvIUwSkGAE0Dv54z3g", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :metric/resolution :high}
