Renewable Energy Approval:** Required regulatory permit (if applicable).\n*   **Eligible Participant:** Specific status required for Supplier eligibility as defined in the rules.\n*   **Representations and Warranties:** Legal assurances provided by the Supplier to the OPA regarding facts and compliance.\n*   **Covenants:** Ongoing promises made by the Supplier for the duration of the contract term.\n\n**Financial Terms**\n*   **Contract Price:** The base rate per kilowatt-hour ($/kWh).\n*   **Indexed Contract Price:** The adjusted price taking into account escalation factors.\n*   **Percentage Escalated:** The portion of the price subject to indexation.\n*   **Generation Payments:** Payments made by the LDC for electricity injected into the grid.\n*   **Settlement Period:** The periodic billing cycle (monthly, quarterly, etc.) for payments.\n*   **Base Date:** The reference date used for price calculations.\n*   **Domestic Content Level:** Requirement for a minimum percentage (60% for solar PV) of local sourcing for equipment.\n*   **Nameplate Capacity:** The total designed output of the facility in kilowatts (kW)."}, :command/name :sheet/complete-node-execution, :command/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T21:11:13.595551-05:00", :command/id #uuid "e1bf03f0-135a-4fc3-8e12-990258d8f19e", :duration-ms 5751, :usage {:prompt-tokens 3120, :completion-tokens 781, :total-tokens 3901}, :inputs {:ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-index 0, :ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-parent #uuid "686d8b87-d077-4284-940d-9e0382fc6c0f"}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "d05aaf33-194e-4eb5-a76f-5b9a0d02d9bf", :sheet-id #uuid "b5bd8208-dee2-409f-b862-7761ff30e225"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3Z8VenZLCR78R1KIPsLCn0XT7iY1_e", :mulog/timestamp 1779243073595, :metric/name "CommandProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3Z8VenZLCR78R1KIPsLCn0XT7iY1_e", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.command-processor-v2.core/process-command, :