l & Operational Terms**\n*   **Designated Activity / Qualifying Percentage:** These define the \"Domestic Content\" requirements. For Concentrated PV, items like cells (14%), primary optics (9%), and labor (19%) contribute to a mandatory 100% total.\n*   **Ontario Supplier:** A vendor required for qualifying electrical hardware (5%–9% toward domestic content).\n*   **Generation Payments:** Financial settlements for power produced, specifically handled through the IESO for LDC Suppliers (Clause 3.2).\n*   **In Parallel:** A specific technical/metering configuration defining the relationship between the facility, the load customer, and the distribution system.\n\n#### **4. Referenced Regulatory Bodies/Codes**\n*   **OPA:** Ontario Power Authority.\n*   **IESO:** Independent Electricity System Operator.\n*   **OEB:** Ontario Energy Board.\n*   **Applicable Codes:** Electricity Act 1998, Transmission System Code, Distribution System Code, Retail Settlement Code."}, :duration-ms 12890, :event/tags #{[:node #uuid "d05aaf33-194e-4eb5-a76f-5b9a0d02d9bf"] [:sheet #uuid "b5bd8208-dee2-409f-b862-7761ff30e225"] [:tick #uuid "219b2581-94f2-4a59-a930-d4b10b8a2717"]}, :event/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T21:11:26.500479-05:00", :usage {:prompt-tokens 2112, :completion-tokens 2670, :total-tokens 4782}, :inputs {:ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-index 4, :ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-parent #uuid "686d8b87-d077-4284-940d-9e0382fc6c0f"}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "d05aaf33-194e-4eb5-a76f-5b9a0d02d9bf", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-completed, :sheet-id #uuid "b5bd8208-dee2-409f-b862-7761ff30e225", :event/id #uuid "019e4326-f2a4-7019-a304-d13a23791200"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3Z9FjvOyzH_1-AkPgNUWOU2Mn66SiA", :mulog/timestamp 1779243086501, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3Z9FjvOyzH_1-AkPgNUWOU2Mn66SiA", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-