ifying Percentages\" toward domestic content targets.\n    *   **Renewable Fuel:** Defined sources including wind, solar (PV), Renewable Biomass, Biogas, landfill gas, and waterpower.\n    *   **LDC (Local Distribution Company):** The entity responsible for local electricity delivery.\n    *   **Renewable Energy Approval:** Regulatory permit from the Ministry of the Environment.\n    *   **Lawfully Permitted Use:** Zoning/legal status of the property (Residential, Agricultural, Commercial, Industrial).\n    *   **Property Identification Number (PIN):** Legal identifier for land parcels."}, :duration-ms 16923, :event/tags #{[:node #uuid "d05aaf33-194e-4eb5-a76f-5b9a0d02d9bf"] [:sheet #uuid "b5bd8208-dee2-409f-b862-7761ff30e225"] [:tick #uuid "219b2581-94f2-4a59-a930-d4b10b8a2717"]}, :event/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T21:11:29.960092-05:00", :usage {:prompt-tokens 3159, :completion-tokens 3592, :total-tokens 6751}, :inputs {:ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-index 3, :ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-parent #uuid "686d8b87-d077-4284-940d-9e0382fc6c0f"}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "d05aaf33-194e-4eb5-a76f-5b9a0d02d9bf", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-completed, :sheet-id #uuid "b5bd8208-dee2-409f-b862-7761ff30e225", :event/id #uuid "019e4327-0028-70c5-8613-950bd44d4a02"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3Z9Sd3oDh0g4jTzvaHIQdY-3iZi9p8", :mulog/timestamp 1779243089962, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3Z9Sd3oDh0g4jTzvaHIQdY-3iZi9p8", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :metric/resolution :high}
