well as any manuals or interpretation bulletins \nissued by the IESO from time to time that are binding on Supplier. \n3.2 Section 2.2.1 of Part 2 of the Contract shall not apply.  Supplier and OPA agree that \nGeneration Payments shall be settled through the IESO or as otherwise agreed in writing \nbetween the Parties. \n3.3 Section 8.3 of Part 2 of the Contract does not apply. Supplier shall notify OPA immediately if \nthe Facility is permanently disconnected. If the Facility is disconnected for more than 20 \ncontinuous Business Days it shall be deemed to be permanently disconnected. \n--- PAGE 22 ---\n  \n3.4 Supplier shall provide OPA and its authorized service providers, agen", :ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-index 3, :ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-parent #uuid "42e7e2ff-fcf2-49db-b8d5-b34d823afcae"}, :node-id #uuid "df853ff0-0550-4452-89c5-310c0d0710ba", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-started, :sheet-id #uuid "b5bd8208-dee2-409f-b862-7761ff30e225", :event/id #uuid "019e4327-133e-7048-97d9-abaf012b1c0c"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3Z9jpS5RdqhDF3K8xfVGvicYnMz-kG", :mulog/timestamp 1779243094846, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3Z9jpS5RdqhDF3K8xfVGvicYnMz-kG", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :metric/resolution :high}
