ion and payment.\n*   **Contract Price:** The base rate per kWh.\n*   **Indexed Contract Price:** The rate adjusted for inflation/escalation.\n*   **Generation Payments:** Payments made to the supplier for electricity injected into the grid.\n*   **Settlement Period:** The billing cycle (monthly, quarterly, etc.).\n*   **Environmental Attributes:** Rights and credits associated with renewable energy production.\n*   **Nameplate Capacity:** The total designed output of the facility in kW.\n*   **Eligible Participant:** A supplier meeting specific program requirements.\n*   **Renewable Energy Approval:** Required regulatory permit for facility operations.\n*   **Laws and Regulations:** Statutory requirements including the *Electricity Act, 1998*.\n*   **Representations and Warranties:** Legally binding assertions regarding the facility and supplier status.\n*   **Covenants:** Ongoing promises to maintain facility characteristics and notify of changes."}, :duration-ms 16626, :event/tags #{[:node #uuid "df853ff0-0550-4452-89c5-310c0d0710ba"] [:sheet #uuid "b5bd8208-dee2-409f-b862-7761ff30e225"] [:tick #uuid "219b2581-94f2-4a59-a930-d4b10b8a2717"]}, :event/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T21:11:46.666152-05:00", :usage {:prompt-tokens 3114, :completion-tokens 3696, :total-tokens 6810}, :inputs {:ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-index 0, :ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-parent #uuid "42e7e2ff-fcf2-49db-b8d5-b34d823afcae"}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "df853ff0-0550-4452-89c5-310c0d0710ba", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-completed, :sheet-id #uuid "b5bd8208-dee2-409f-b862-7761ff30e225", :event/id #uuid "019e4327-416a-70fa-bdca-8d586b68a629"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3ZAQrvZv0yQZsAKX5FddNbiz2S6-i9", :mulog/timestamp 1779243106668, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3ZAQrvZv0yQZsAKX5FddNbiz2S6-i9", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :m